@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title 树打印：可替换接口与后续 Adapter 接入
class "main" as Main
class CliApplication <<Client>>
class ShapeQueryService
class TreeView <<readonly data>>
interface TreePrinter <<Target>> {
  +format(tree: TreeView): readonly string[]
}
class TreeFormatter {
  +format(tree: TreeView)
}
class OutlineTreeAdapter <<Adapter, test only>> {
  -adaptee: OutlineLibrary
  +format(tree: TreeView)
}
class OutlineLibrary <<Adaptee, test only>> {
  +draw(nodes: OutlineNode[]): string
}
Main ..> TreeFormatter : 创建默认实现
Main ..> CliApplication : 注入 TreePrinter
ShapeQueryService ..> TreeView : 生成查询快照
CliApplication --> TreePrinter : 仅依赖接口
TreePrinter ..> TreeView : 消费
TreeFormatter ..|> TreePrinter
OutlineTreeAdapter ..|> TreePrinter
OutlineTreeAdapter --> OutlineLibrary : 转换数据 / 委派 draw
note bottom of TreeFormatter
  深度优先遍历，生成树线与缩进
  不导入具体 Shape，不修改领域状态
end note
@enduml
